button onClick={() => context.emit('sendMessage', props.message)}>
        {props.message} {' '}
    </button>


FComponent.props = {
  message: {
    type: String,
    required: true


FComponent.emits = {
  sendMessage: (value: unknown) => typeof value === 'string'

```

**Anonymous Functional Component**
